1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,110
You waited all day

2
00:00:01,110 --> 00:00:01,990
for this evening.

3
00:00:02,310 --> 00:00:03,280
Now you're home.

4
00:00:03,410 --> 00:00:04,310
Shoes off.

5
00:00:04,350 --> 00:00:05,070
Phone out.

6
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,710
Just five minutes.

7
00:00:07,210 --> 00:00:08,150
Then you look up.

8
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:09,440
It's almost bedtime.

9
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:10,140
The guitar

10
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:10,890
you wanted to play

11
00:00:10,890 --> 00:00:11,940
hasn't moved.

12
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:12,960
Your evening became

13
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:13,640
a waiting room

14
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:14,550
for tomorrow.

15
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:16,070
Try changing

16
00:00:16,070 --> 00:00:17,120
just the beginning.

17
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:18,620
Tomorrow,

18
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:19,370
before you open

19
00:00:19,370 --> 00:00:19,830
a feed,

20
00:00:19,830 --> 00:00:20,660
put your phone down

21
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:21,110
and pick up

22
00:00:21,110 --> 00:00:21,900
the guitar.

23
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:24,180
Play one song.

24
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:24,990
Badly,

25
00:00:24,990 --> 00:00:25,880
if you have to.

26
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:26,600
You don't have to

27
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:27,230
make your evening

28
00:00:27,230 --> 00:00:28,060
productive.

29
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:28,780
Give yourself

30
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:29,400
one moment

31
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:30,700
you actually chose.
